--- !u!114 &1265083219571110519
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1633681884524845999}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 50ea15d35cf4a1f4794f0508cdeea827, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CalculusLabEscape.MathText
  source: 'POWER RULE  /  n != -1

    Integral of a*x^n dx = a*x^(n+1)/(n+1) + C


    TERM
    BY TERM

    Integrate each term separately, then add one common +C.


    ROOTS
    AND RECIPROCALS

    Rewrite sqrt(x) as x^(1/2) before raising the exponent.


    DEFINITE
    INTEGRALS

    Find an antiderivative F, then compute F(upper) - F(lower). No
    +C in the result.'
